<title>COLOMBIA: Banco de Bogota net profit soars.</title>
<headline>Banco de Bogota net profit soars.</headline>
<text>
<p>BOGOTA, May 7 Reuter - Colombia's Banco de Bogota, the flagship of the Luis Carlos Sarmiento financial empire, posted the following first quarter results, the banking superintendency said Wednesday:</p>
<p>		  Q1 1997		  Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profits     47.5 billion	    21.8 billion</p>
<p>Total assets 2.73 trillion	   2.36 trillion.</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Colombian pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
